{"4360740": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Skygrove", "steam_appid": 4360740, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Skygrove  is a cozy pixel art fantasy adventure </strong>about restoring a corrupted town, rescuing animals, and uncovering the mystery behind the stolen starlight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The town of Skygrove is fading.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An ancient darkness has swallowed the stars, leaving forests to decay and opening portals to a corrupted realm. Animals have vanished from their habitats, mysterious fog blankets the land, and the once silent Guardians who protected the town  are nowhere to be found.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are Sol, a human chosen by the last remaining Starlight. Guided by a fading glow, you must venture into dangerous portals, recover lost fragments of light, restore ancient Monoliths, and bring life back to Skygrove before the darkness consumes everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u></u></strong><br><br><br><br><strong><u>Features</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4360740/extras/60b59aa961a674a81a166f108d5bcee0.poster.avif?t=1788001619\" width=32 height=32 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4360740/extras/60b59aa961a674a81a166f108d5bcee0.webm?t=1788001619\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rescue &amp; Raise Animals</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover animals lost to the darkness and give them a new home on your land. Feed them, build bonds, learn their personalities, unlock unique behaviors, and watch them grow alongside you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build Meaningful Bonds</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each animal has its own personality, traits, moods, bond levels, thoughts, and journal history. Learn what they love, care for them daily, and unlock special milestone behaviors as your friendship grows.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore Portals</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter mysterious portals leading to a corrupted realm filled with monsters, hidden resources, and ancient secrets. Progress through portal levels, gather rare materials, and challenge powerful bosses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Uncover the Mystery</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Investigate the disappearance of the starlight and discover what happened to the Guardians of Skygrove. Meet villagers, gather clues, and reveal the truth hidden within the darkness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Live Through the Seasons</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the changing seasons of Skygrove, each bringing new sights, opportunities, and discoveries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customize Your Life</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Personalize your character, home, and land as you build a sanctuary for the animals you rescue.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >+ And so much <strong>more</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>About Me</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hi, I'm Argus.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I created this game by myself with the hope of building a cozy world you can enjoy at your own pace. Thank you for playing, and I hope it brings you a little comfort and happiness. 💖</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Skygrove  is a cozy pixel art fantasy adventure </strong>about restoring a corrupted town, rescuing animals, and uncovering the mystery behind the stolen starlight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The town of Skygrove is fading.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An ancient darkness has swallowed the stars, leaving forests to decay and opening portals to a corrupted realm. Animals have vanished from their habitats, mysterious fog blankets the land, and the once silent Guardians who protected the town  are nowhere to be found.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are Sol, a human chosen by the last remaining Starlight. Guided by a fading glow, you must venture into dangerous portals, recover lost fragments of light, restore ancient Monoliths, and bring life back to Skygrove before the darkness consumes everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u></u></strong><br><br><br><br><strong><u>Features</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4360740/extras/60b59aa961a674a81a166f108d5bcee0.poster.avif?t=1788001619\" width=32 height=32 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4360740/extras/60b59aa961a674a81a166f108d5bcee0.webm?t=1788001619\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rescue &amp; Raise Animals</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover animals lost to the darkness and give them a new home on your land. Feed them, build bonds, learn their personalities, unlock unique behaviors, and watch them grow alongside you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build Meaningful Bonds</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each animal has its own personality, traits, moods, bond levels, thoughts, and journal history. Learn what they love, care for them daily, and unlock special milestone behaviors as your friendship grows.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore Portals</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter mysterious portals leading to a corrupted realm filled with monsters, hidden resources, and ancient secrets. Progress through portal levels, gather rare materials, and challenge powerful bosses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Uncover the Mystery</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Investigate the disappearance of the starlight and discover what happened to the Guardians of Skygrove. Meet villagers, gather clues, and reveal the truth hidden within the darkness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Live Through the Seasons</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the changing seasons of Skygrove, each bringing new sights, opportunities, and discoveries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customize Your Life</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Personalize your character, home, and land as you build a sanctuary for the animals you rescue.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >+ And so much <strong>more</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>About Me</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hi, I'm Argus.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I created this game by myself with the hope of building a cozy world you can enjoy at your own pace. Thank you for playing, and I hope it brings you a little comfort and happiness. 💖</p>", "short_description": "The world of Skygrove is fading. As Sol, chosen by the last remaining starlight, rescue animals, explore corrupted portals, recover lost light, and restore hope to a dying town in this cozy pixel-art fantasy adventure.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4360740/5671e9fbc5b3b156acefcc9618ba4